      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it's more than just being tired. it's like... if you look at it objectively, nothing really has an inherent value. there's no mathematical or logical reason why life is \"better\" than non-existence. if everything is neutral, then why is there this massive pressure to keep going? isn't the choice to just stop actually just a neutral, logical move?",
